{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still Remember is a 2D top-down adventure game inspired by titles like UNDERTALE, DELTARUNE, and OMORI.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the player, awaken in the afterlife \u2014 a mysterious place divided into different layers, each filled with challenges, secrets, and choices that shape your journey. Upon arrival, your memories are taken from you, but one feeling remains: the need to move forward to reunite with someone special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you will encounter unique characters \u2014 some willing to help, others determined to stop your progress. Intense battles against enemies and bosses, emotional cutscenes, and a branching narrative lead to multiple endings, making each playthrough a unique experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033400?t=1760897414","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033400?t=1760897414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033400/9bbf232f8695121926812ed2636d80cc3f7bbcfd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760897414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033400/9bbf232f8695121926812ed2636d80cc3f7bbcfd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760897414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still Remember is a 2D top-down adventure game inspired by titles like UNDERTALE, DELTARUNE, and OMORI.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the player, awaken in the afterlife \u2014 a mysterious place divided into different layers, each filled with challenges, secrets, and choices that shape your jour